  <wpt lat="55.162212" lon="-2.092182"><name>#1 Spot near Cranester Bog</name><desc>Score 64. gaps between trees or buildings to fly through; lone trees or pillars to orbit and power-loop; a good mix of obstacles and open space. Open A3: clear of the A3 distances (150 m from houses, businesses and parks; 50 m from buildings and busy roads).</desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
